		{"id":"d49b73e33e6221aa","type":"text","text":"**Particle system** - a collection of separate small objects (particles) that are set into motion using some algorithm","x":-12800,"y":9288,"width":868,"height":65},
		{"id":"bc17ee91aaf06b0b","type":"text","text":"**Particle** - atomic element of particle system which contains attributes (e.g., position, velocity, size, color, etc.)","x":-12800,"y":9389,"width":868,"height":60},
		{"id":"45b0c8cc3e8864e1","type":"text","text":"**Feedback loop** - for each frame, particle attributes are computed using old values and algorithm","x":-12800,"y":9488,"width":868,"height":60},
		{"id":"ae77a46f6c55ea9c","type":"text","text":"**Modeling** - we define number of particles, their attributes, forces which affect particles and display options.","x":-12800,"y":9662,"width":868,"height":60},
		{"id":"a6474ca1279305d1","type":"text","text":"**Rendering** - particles are drawn to screen each frame taking in account current attributes and drawing options","x":-12800,"y":9570,"width":868,"height":59},
