		{"id":"ef6609870b62b613","type":"text","text":"Volume from particles (rasterize volume)","x":-3540,"y":7692,"width":257,"height":62},
		{"id":"1fd0fb4d0fedad69","type":"text","text":"Convert volume to particles for artistic particle system morphing (advection) using volumetric vector field:\n* It is easier to model forces on particles and then to convert those to volume \n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WySzeEniScs\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wR0SDptfygg","x":-5205,"y":7150,"width":1008,"height":367},
