		{"id":"944e6961fa61d1fd","type":"text","text":"**Attributes** in Houdini is data attached/stored on geometry.\n\nFor example, points, primitives or vertices can have attributes:\n* https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/model/attributes.html\n\n**Also, particles have attributes:**\n* https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/dopparticles/attributes.html\n\nEach particle in particle system has **two main attributes: position (P) and velocity (v)** - direction and speed and also: age, id, etc.","x":-12506,"y":11229,"width":740,"height":308},
		{"id":"33de49bd56ec4b07","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/Examples/InsideFire.jpg","x":-16693,"y":5401,"width":538,"height":317},
