		{"id":"ef39a8b3c1d14c67","type":"text","text":"Example 2 (file: SurfaceFolow):\n* Create sourcing geometry and initial attribs (Cd, N, etc.)\n* Use POP Net for particle system\n* Inside POP Net:\n\t* Use Point VOP to drive particles using noise vector field\n\t* Use SOP Solver to iteratively raycast particles on sourcing geometry\n*  After POP Net, use particles to form trails","x":-5882,"y":1240,"width":807,"height":284},
		{"id":"4003a76034293565","type":"text","text":"Initial attributes","x":-4685,"y":651,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"07440970d37a679d","type":"text","text":"Example 1 (file: VectorFieldSourcing):\n* Create sourcing geometry and initial attribs (Cd, N, etc.)\n* Use POP Net for particle system\n* Inside POP Net use Geometry/Point VOP to drive particles using noise vector field\n*  After POP Net, use particles to form trails","x":-5882,"y":402,"width":680,"height":180},
